Description: toggle fullscreen with the F key, keeping the aspect ratio
 The intro is rendered at its original resolution, then blitted to the
 window with glBlitFramebuffer, centered with black bars, when the window
 is switched to SDL_WINDOW_FULLSCREEN_DESKTOP.
